# Fetichism (Bastok 1-3, mission.bastok.fetichism). A level 10 Warrior of Bastok holding the four Quadav Fetich parts
# (1-1 and 1-2 completed by a GM: no mission current; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's 30035 out of the logins).
# Section 1 (no current mission, a Bastokan): the gate guards have no handler of their own, so each plays its script's
# mission list 1001; the finish of Bastok Markets, Bastok Mines and Metalworks with option 0 (not 2)
# does nothing; Port Bastok's with option 2 begins the mission (YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION). Section 2 (1-3 current): Argus,
# Cleades, Rashid and Malduc each play their zone's ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6. Argus: one fetich part: no match, no
# event; the four parts: 1008 (the mission not completed), whose finish completes it (1000 gil, rank 2, 200 rank points)
# and takes the parts. Completed: Argus has no section 2 (his script's default); the mission current again (a GM) with
# the parts given again: the four parts play 1005 (completed before), whose finish completes it once more. Rival
# zone-in, another mission's script: the login in Bastok Markets plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West
# onZoneIn, which returns 22 (the trace records only that return, with no event packet).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/Argus/onTrade PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/onEventFinish/1005 PortBastok/onEventFinish/1008
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
item QuadavFetichHead
item QuadavFetichTorso
item QuadavFetichArms
item QuadavFetichLegs
login
trigger Cleades                         # section 1: no handler: his script's 1001
finish option=0                         # not 2: nothing
warp -8.4,-1,-121 BastokMines
trigger Rashid                          # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 2: nothing
warp 64,-14,-4 Metalworks
trigger Malduc                          # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 2: nothing
warp 132,8.5,-4 PortBastok
trigger Argus                           # section 1: 1001
finish option=2                         # 2: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
trigger Argus                           # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6
warp -358,-10,-168 BastokMarkets
trigger Cleades                         # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6
warp -8.4,-1,-121 BastokMines
trigger Rashid                          # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6
warp 64,-14,-4 Metalworks
trigger Malduc                          # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6
warp 132,8.5,-4 PortBastok
walk 131,8.5,-4
trade Argus QuadavFetichHead x1         # one part: tradeMatches fails: no event
trade Argus QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # 1008
finish                                  # completed: gil, rank, rank points; the parts taken
trigger Argus                           # completed: section 1 again: his script's 1001
finish option=0                         # not 2: nothing
mission Bastok Fetichism current        # a GM
item QuadavFetichHead
item QuadavFetichTorso
item QuadavFetichArms
item QuadavFetichLegs
trade Argus QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # 1005: done before
finish                                  # completed again
